[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0244","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0685","title":"Netscape Communicator EMBED 标签缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.06至4.61版本在处理HTML的EMBED标签中的pluginspage选项时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，诱使用户访问后触发缓冲区溢出，导致浏览器崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响Netscape Communicator 4.x系列多个版本，CVSS评分5.1，危害等级中等。建议用户升级至不受影响的版本或更换其他浏览器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0685"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:50Z","remediation":"Netscape Communicator 已停止维护多年，建议立即卸载该软件，改用 Mozilla Firefox、Google Chrome 等现代浏览器。如因遗留系统必须使用，可在浏览器设置中禁用插件加载功能，或通过注册表禁用 EMBED 标签的 pluginspage 参数解析，同时避免访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/618","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19486","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/985d46f062894917f05cdf3d64399a32839d12b7/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0685.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0685","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0685.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d448b12fda744aa8491fddc8705260f2b4289f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0685.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5bd4fceb27857756215e988f4824b12d3de84ec1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qr94-86r9-f9hg/GHSA-qr94-86r9-f9hg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0685.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0244.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0244.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0970","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0970.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1129","title":"Cisco Catalyst 2900 VLAN交换机 802.1q未授权VLAN遍历漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 2900 系列虚拟局域网（VLAN）交换机存在 IEEE 802.1q VLAN 遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 trunk 标记中伪造 VLAN 标识符，向目标 VLAN 注入特制的 802.1q 帧，从而跨越 VLAN 边界访问本应隔离的网络资源。该漏洞允许攻击者绕过 VLAN 隔离机制，实现未授权的跨 VLAN 通信，可能导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，影响范围广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1129"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:46Z","remediation":"在 Cisco Catalyst 2900 系列交换机的 trunk 端口上启用 802.1Q 原生 VLAN（native VLAN）隔离，将管理流量与用户 VLAN 分离，并为 trunk 链路配置明确的 allowed VLAN 列表（switchport trunk allowed vlan 仅放行必要 VLAN）。同时升级交换机 IOS 至修复该 802.1Q 标签伪造遍历问题的版本（如 12.0(5)WC 及以上），无法立即升级时关闭不必要的 DTP 自动协商（switchport mode trunk + switchport nonegotiate）以缓解未授权 VLAN 注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/univercd/cc/td/doc/product/lan/28201900/1928v8x/eescg8x/aleakyv.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/26008","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/615","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3294","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24512263eb77d6af2cecd67bd2460f761fc94bea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1129","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3bc9583077e9d7007badef726c5b3560d73fb205/1999/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7d67702de1c8e6c388afcd41c6fc66f9bddaa76f/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-11xx/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1129.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1129.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0970.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0400","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0705","title":"ISC INN inews 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC INN（InterNetNews）2.2 版本中的 inews 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序用于向 Usenet 新闻服务器投递文章，攻击者可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的新闻文章内容触发溢出，无需身份认证即可利用。成功利用可导致远程代码执行或服务拒绝，影响运行该版本的 Linux 服务器及其上承载的新闻服务。CVSS v2 评分为 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限即可实施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0705"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:53Z","remediation":"立即将 ISC INN 升级至 2.2.1 或更高版本（官方已修复该缓冲区溢出），Red Hat Linux 6.0 用户应通过 up2date 或 rpm 命令安装厂商提供的 inn 安全更新包（如 inn-2.2-3 以上）。如暂时无法升级，可将 inews 二进制文件权限设为 0750 并归属至受限新闻组用户组，移除其他用户的执行权限，同时限制本地不可信用户登录以缓解被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/616","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19480","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9fb3a936a0c1d10acf1532bf38ee04d3d8b03656/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0705.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0705","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0705.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/30f77465b94d71209b45a239e791a1fe062c9e8b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0705.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c4492e06ae2b58d2cc1a5b6e3d1be4567633e24b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-43p9-vj97-wmgv/GHSA-43p9-vj97-wmgv.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/inn.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/1999/CVE-1999-0705.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/616/info.html","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19990907.data","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0202","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0670","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Eyedog ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 中的 Eyedog ActiveX 控件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发 ActiveX 控件的缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 IE 4.0/5.0 等早期版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击者只需诱导受害者打开包含恶意代码的网页即可触发。CVSS 评分 4.0，属于中等严重度漏洞，微软已发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0670"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载或禁用 Eyedog ActiveX 控件，在 Internet Explorer 中通过“Internet 选项”→“程序”→“管理加载项”禁用 Eyedog 控件，或直接卸载相关软件；若必须使用 IE，请升级至 IE 6 SP1 及以上版本并安装微软发布的安全补丁 MS99-032 (MS99-032) 修补该漏洞，同时建议在防火墙层面禁用 ActiveX 控件下载作为临时缓解措施","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-064.shtml","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-032","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dcf4a672831d0af7dbd00779c08b91c153bbd3e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0670.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0670","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0670.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/512c773c61886081b2589de76a8cfde795349819/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0670.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vw7j-x4wv-gff4/GHSA-vw7j-x4wv-gff4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0670.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88352/info.html","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0202.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0196","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0669","title":"微软 Internet Explorer 4/5 ActiveX 'Eyedog' 控件安全标记错误导致远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4/5 中的 Eyedog ActiveX 控件被错误标记为\"安全可脚本化\"，导致远程攻击者可通过网页诱导用户访问，利用该控件执行任意系统命令。漏洞影响 IE 4.0、5.0 及集成该浏览器的 Windows 95/98/NT 系统，攻击者无需认证即可在用户权限下运行代码。Bubbleboy 蠕虫即利用此漏洞通过 HTML 邮件自动传播，无需用户点击附件。该漏洞源于 ActiveX 安全模型缺陷，微软后续通过安全补丁修复并改进了 ActiveX 签名验证机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0669"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:48Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Internet Explorer 6 或更高版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS99-037 为 Eyedog ActiveX 控件设置 killbit 以禁用该控件。在 IE 中将 Internet 区域的安全级别设为「高」并禁用「对标记为可安全执行脚本的 ActiveX 控件执行脚本」选项，可临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/j-064.shtml","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19487","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d0ba8eaeba3ff3558e6044a19d5b454dcc12f33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0669.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0669","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0669.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/512c773c61886081b2589de76a8cfde795349819/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0669.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3c5965e4a3ad0d0b437f880f71224c9e3d8d5fd5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m9vr-8q37-f2rh/GHSA-m9vr-8q37-f2rh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0669.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--231fc8ca-ffbe-47b7-994f-ed5754a27cb7.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0196.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0196.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0196.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1289","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1289.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1027","title":"Solaris 部分 setuid 程序权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中某些 setuid 程序由于对用户输入或环境变量处理不当，存在权限提升漏洞。本地已认证用户可借助特洛伊木马或不当的环境配置，使这些以 root 权限运行的程序执行其指定的命令，从而获取系统最高权限。攻击者需具备本地登录权限并能影响相关程序的执行环境方可利用该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1027"],"sources":["avd","cve"],"published":"1999-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"应用 Sun 官方提供的相应补丁，或将存在问题的 setuid 程序移除 setuid 位，并限制普通用户对关键环境变量的修改以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T14:35:27Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1027","https://www.securityfocus.com/bid/640"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1289.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0864","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0864.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1014","title":"Solaris 7.0 /usr/bin/mail -m 参数本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 系统自带的 /usr/bin/mail 程序在处理 -m 命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出缺陷。本地普通用户可构造超长的 -m 参数内容，覆盖栈上返回地址，从而在本地以特权（如 root）身份执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。攻击者需具备本地登录或命令执行权限方可触发该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1014"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1999-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 7 已修复该问题的补丁版本（Sun 官方建议安装 Solaris 7 Maintenance Update 或对应内核补丁簇），或限制对 /usr/bin/mail 的 setuid 权限并避免以特权身份调用该命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T12:18:30Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1014","https://www.securityfocus.com/bid/608"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0864.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0864.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0684","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0891","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 下载行为组件远程文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5 的 download behavior 功能允许网页作者通过客户端脚本下载文件。设计上应仅允许下载同域文件以防止跨域读取，但攻击者可通过服务端 HTTP 重定向绕过此同源限制，使恶意网站能够读取用户本地文件系统及内网中的任意文件。该漏洞属于代码注入类（CWE-94），攻击者无需用户交互即可触发，影响所有安装 IE5 的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0891"],"sources":["cve","ms"],"published":"1999-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"微软已发布 MS99-040 安全公告及补丁修复此漏洞。由于 Internet Explorer 5 已停止支持超过 20 年，建议立即升级至受支持的现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge 或 Chrome）。若因系统兼容性必须使用旧版 IE，可配置组策略禁用 ActiveX 下载行为组件并将受信站点区域安全级别设为高。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-040","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ242542","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/37828","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/674","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/k-002.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/11274"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0684.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0684.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0684.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0474","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0758","title":"Netscape Enterprise 与 FastTrack Web 服务器源代码泄露漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Netscape Enterprise Server 3.5.1 与 Netscape FastTrack Server 3.01 中。服务器在处理 URL 时未能正确处理 URL 编码的空格字符（%20），当攻击者向一个 CGI 脚本或服务器端脚本的 URL 末尾追加 %20 时，服务器会错误地将请求解析为对源文件的访问，从而将本不应返回的脚本源代码直接返回给客户端。攻击无需身份认证，仅需构造包含 %20 的简单 HTTP 请求即可读取服务器端脚本源码，导致应用程序逻辑、内部实现及潜在敏感信息泄露，为后续进一步攻击提供线索。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0758"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Netscape Enterprise Server 3.6 或 FastTrack Server 3.02 及以上版本；临时缓解可在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理或重写规则，拒绝 URL 路径中包含 %20 编码的脚本请求，并限制对脚本源文件的直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0758","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0758.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1145","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1145.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1515","title":"TenFour TFS Gateway 4.0 邮件地址处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"TenFour TFS Gateway 4.0 在非默认配置下存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送包含错误发件人和收件人地址的消息触发该漏洞，导致网关每隔 10 秒持续尝试退回该消息，从而耗尽系统资源造成服务不可用。该漏洞利用门槛较低，仅需能够向目标网关发送消息即可触发，属于典型的应用层逻辑缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1515"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:36Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于非默认配置选项启用后的异常行为，建议将 TFS Gateway 恢复为出厂默认配置，关闭消息回退重试功能；或升级到厂商修补后的最新版本。如无法升级，可在网关或上游防火墙处限制不受信任来源的 SMTP 连接，并对发往无效地址的出站消息数量实施速率限制，防止因反复回退重试耗尽系统资源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/613","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3290","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19477","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4441343672f486c63736487674c197dfd2a4f256/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1515.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1515","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1515.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/33dc7d7c01654661dd82814415270cb51d2d0728/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1515.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68q7-2qpc-87mh/GHSA-68q7-2qpc-87mh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/613/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1515.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d1321841542ad681aa90ebf69f41b355bb7e4c9b/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0503","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0774","title":"Martin Stover Mars NetWare Emulation 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Martin Stover 开发的 Mars NetWare Emulation（NWE，即 mars_nwe）软件包存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，其根源在于程序在处理目录名称时未对输入长度进行边界校验，将过长的目录名直接拷贝至固定大小的栈缓冲区中，从而触发缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响 mars_nwe 0.99 及相近版本，主要危害运行该 NetWare 仿真服务的 Linux/Unix 系统。攻击者需具备在受影响系统上创建或访问含超长名称目录的权限（通常为本地用户），通过构造异常长的目录名称即可利用该漏洞改写栈内存并返回地址，实现任意代码执行或导致服务崩溃。利用方式多为本地提权，即普通用户借助溢出发起恶意载荷以获取更高权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0774"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:01Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Martin Stower Mars NWE 至修复版本 0.99p（或后续官方版本），从 https://www.comlab.ghg.net/mars_nwe/ 获取并重新编译安装。如无法立即升级，可限制对 NWE 服务的本地目录访问权限、移除不可信用户的本地登录权限，并仅以必要权限运行 mars_nwe 守护进程作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/617","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19485","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7cda0b7fa75f17f1e2b56ef076a6f9175f854ab4/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0774.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0774","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0774.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4cacb08131e7c4736ad136de17873dbcaeddf850/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0774.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wf4p-xcfq-g2qq/GHSA-wf4p-xcfq-g2qq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0774.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1143","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1513","title":"3Com SuperStack II hub Management Information Base (MIB) 信息泄露漏洞","description":"3Com SuperStack II 集线器运行软件版本 2.10 中的管理信息库（MIB）存在信息泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于 MIB 中对象标识符 .1.3.6.1.4.1.43.10.4.2 在只读团体字符串权限下即可访问，但该标识符会列出完整的团体字符串表。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 SNMP 协议读取该 OID，获取所有团体字符串，进而利用获取的读写团体字符串对设备进行未授权配置修改或信息窃取。该漏洞影响 3Com SuperStack II 系列集线器设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1513"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:36Z","remediation":"3Com SuperStack II hub 已停止支持且无官方补丁。建议立即升级到支持 SNMPv3 的替代设备；如无法更换，须在边界防火墙上限制 SNMP 端口（UDP 161/162）仅允许受信管理 IP 访问，并将 SNMP read-only community 字符串修改为复杂随机值，同时禁用默认 public/private 字符串，定期审计 SNMP 访问日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93616983223090&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5dccbdd02e04ed15263189c9e9adec0bd125446a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1513.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1513","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1513.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/33dc7d7c01654661dd82814415270cb51d2d0728/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1513.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gwm8-rgj9-362f/GHSA-gwm8-rgj9-362f.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1513.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87920/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/d1321841542ad681aa90ebf69f41b355bb7e4c9b/1999.tsv","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1143.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1071","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1354","title":"Softarc FirstClass 网络服务器电子邮件客户端明文凭据存储漏洞","description":"Softarc FirstClass 网络服务器 5.506 及更早版本的 E-mail 客户端存在敏感信息明文存储漏洞。程序将用户登录凭据（用户名和密码）以未加密的明文形式保存在本地文件中，包括 5.506 版本的 home.fc、3.5 版本的 network.fc 以及开启日志时的 FCCLIENT.LOG 文件。攻击者在获取受害者主机访问权限后，可直接读取上述文件中的凭据信息，进而利用泄露的账号登录 FirstClass 服务，导致横向移动或权限提升。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1354"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-08-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:15Z","remediation":"该漏洞厂商从未发布补丁且产品已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的邮件系统（如 Microsoft Exchange 或开源方案）。如无法迁移，须在客户端设置中取消勾选\"保存密码\"选项，避免将凭据写入 home.fc/network.fc 文件；同时禁用 FCCLIENT.LOG 日志记录功能，并严格限制客户端计算机的物理访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93637687305327&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93698283309513&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1354.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1354","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1354.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1354.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vm2r-v9g5-m7v4/GHSA-vm2r-v9g5-m7v4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1354.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000754.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--80742b1f-750a-4cc5-b3e9-d6215f20b69b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1209","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0911","title":"ProFTPD MKD/CWD 命令远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ProFTPd 1.2 pre1 至 pre5 版本、wu-ftpd 及 beroftpd 等 FTP 服务器软件存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 MKD（创建目录）和 CWD（切换目录）命令序列，构造嵌套目录结构触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞危害严重，攻击者可在完全控制受影响服务器后执行任意代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0911"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:18Z","remediation":"升级 ProFTPd 至 1.2.0rc1 或更高版本，升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.6.1 或更高版本，升级 beroftpd 至已修复版本。如无法升级，在 inetd/xinetd 配置中禁用匿名 FTP 写入权限，并限制 MKD/CWD 命令的目录深度。同时建议迁移至仍在维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/1999/19990210","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/612","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19476","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/83494e95424aced4cfc65648b3019774f7fc51c3/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0911.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0911","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/1999/CVE-1999-0911/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0911.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03324c0426abad4e55ae7c73b0bba67b9c87e4ea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0911.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mmm-q9r4-mm4v/GHSA-7mmm-q9r4-mm4v.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9230692740a5b211bda51742c17a001e1943a803/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0911.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/proftpd_pre6_exploit.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/612/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0866","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0866.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1016","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9189,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10871}}","description":"Microsoft 的 HTML 控件在 Internet Explorer 5.0、FrontPage Express、Outlook Express 5 及 Eudora 等多款软件中存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 HTML 控件对表单字段的处理逻辑缺陷，当远程攻击者构造包含超大尺寸 HTML 表单字段（如表单元格中的大型文本输入框）的恶意网页或 HTML 邮件时，目标软件在渲染该页面时会陷入持续处理状态，导致 CPU 占用率飙升至 100%。攻击条件为诱使用户访问恶意网站或打开特制 HTML 邮件，无需身份认证或特殊权限，成功利用可使受害者系统失去响应，造成可用性耗尽型拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1016"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:31Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01 Service Pack 1 或更高版本（安装微软 1999 年 9 月累积安全更新），FrontPage Express、Outlook Express 5 同步更新至对应补丁版本。临时缓解措施：在 Outlook Express 与 Eudora 中禁用 HTML 邮件预览、以纯文本方式阅读邮件，并使用浏览器安全区域限制自动加载远程网页内容，避免访问不可信站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=93578772920970&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/606","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19471","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1016.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2126251525a2d370e